{"id":"4C","title":"Bribery","part":{"n":4,"title":"Law and Justice"},"url":"/law/04-law-and-justice/4c","entries":[{"id":"4C.1","text":"You are not to take a gift or money offered as a bribe.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":16,"verses":"19"},{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":19,"verses":"7"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":33,"verses":"15"}],"citation":"Deut. 16:19; 2 Chron. 19:7; Isa. 33:15."},{"id":"4C.2","text":"Bribery condemned as being wicked and perverting justice and judgment.","refs":[{"book":"1 Samuel","chapter":8,"verses":"3"},{"book":"Job","chapter":15,"verses":"34"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":26,"verses":"9-10"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":17,"verses":"23"},{"book":"Ecclesiastes","chapter":7,"verses":"7"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":1,"verses":"23"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":5,"verses":"23"},{"book":"Ezekiel","chapter":13,"verses":"19"},{"book":"Amos","chapter":5,"verses":"12"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":26,"verses":"14-15"}],"citation":"1 Sam. 8:3; Job. 15:34; Psa. 26:9-10; Prov. 17:23; Eccl. 7:7; Isa. 1:23; Isa. 5:23; Ezek. 13:19; Amos 5:12; Matt. 26:14-15."},{"id":"4C.3","text":"He who takes a bribe against the innocent may not dwell in the LORD's holy nation.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":15,"verses":"1,5"}],"citation":"Psa. 15:1, 5."},{"id":"4C.4","text":"You shall not take a bribe, for a bribe blinds the wise and subverts the cause of the just.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":23,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"Exod. 23:8."},{"id":"4C.5","text":"Those in government who take bribes overthrows the justice and stability established in the land.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":29,"verses":"4"}],"citation":"Prov. 29:4."},{"id":"4C.6","text":"They are cursed who take reward against the innocent.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":27,"verses":"25"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":15,"verses":"5"}],"citation":"Deut. 27:25; Psa. 15:5."},{"id":"4C.7","text":"He that hates gifts is blessed.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":15,"verses":"27"}],"citation":"Prov. 15:27."},{"id":"4C.8","text":"It is iniquity for judges to pronounce judgment for a bribe or reward.","refs":[{"book":"Micah","chapter":3,"verses":"10-11"}],"citation":"Mic. 3:10- 11."}]}